WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:00.775
Try it.

2
00:00:00.775 --> 00:00:04.113
Lab 1 normalizes and
registers two fictional

3
00:00:04.113 --> 00:00:07.012
runs of a Contoso tenant, two weeks apart.

4
00:00:07.012 --> 00:00:09.488
Step one normalizes the first run.

5
00:00:09.488 --> 00:00:14.881
Thirty-three tests: eight pass, seventeen
fail, one planned, two skipped for

6
00:00:14.881 --> 00:00:20.363
licensing, one disconnected, two not
applicable, and two unable to evaluate.

7
00:00:20.363 --> 00:00:23.188
Seventeen findings, one
of them investigate.

8
00:00:23.188 --> 00:00:28.113
The tool marked sixteen failed; the
investigate result makes seventeen.

9
00:00:28.113 --> 00:00:32.113
The eight that are neither pass nor
finding are in their own columns.

10
00:00:32.113 --> 00:00:34.462
Step two reads the dispositions.

11
00:00:34.462 --> 00:00:39.562
Two skips for licensing, two not
applicable, one disconnected, one planned.

12
00:00:39.562 --> 00:00:44.766
And two unable to evaluate: test two
four five four eight ended in error,

13
00:00:44.766 --> 00:00:47.099
and four one oh five oh timed out.

14
00:00:47.099 --> 00:00:50.662
Both of those are a run to
fix, not a control to fail.

15
00:00:50.662 --> 00:00:53.222
The slide leaves out
the written-to line and

16
00:00:53.222 --> 00:00:55.700
the table's underline;
the page shows them.
